      "description": "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p><span class=\"TextRun SCXW22569549 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW22569549 BCX0\">AssetWatch</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW22569549 BCX0\"> serves global manufacturers by powering manufacturing uptime through the delivery of an unparalleled condition monitoring experience, with a passion to care about the assets our customers care for every day. We are a devoted and capable team that includes world-renowned engineers and distinguished business leaders united by a common goal – To build the future of predictive maintenance. As we enter the next phase of rapid growth, we are seeking people to help lead the journey.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW22569549 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></p></div><p><span data-contrast=\"none\">At AssetWatch, we are committed to maximizing manufacturing uptime by delivering a proactive condition monitoring experience. Our team of experts shares a common goal: to be the world's leading condition monitoring platform, helping manufacturers eliminate unplanned downtime worldwide.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:400,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 2\">Position Overview</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:200,&quot;335559739&quot;:200,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">The Vice President of Customer Success is a senior executive leader who owns the commercial performance of AssetWatch's installed customer base, maximizing long-term customer value through world-class adoption, retention, expansion, and operational excellence. This position plays a critical role in shaping AssetWatch's post-sale strategy and market position, with direct accountability for customer outcomes, team performance, and enterprise-wide customer-centric initiatives.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">The Vice President of Customer Success is expected to build a world-class Customer Success organization capable of supporting a business scaling to $200M+ ARR while maintaining industry-leading retention and customer satisfaction and is responsible to lead a team across multiple levels and regions, ensuring consistent delivery of world-class service, driving product adoption, and embedding AI-powered solutions and best practices throughout the organization.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 2\">Key Responsibilities</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:200,&quot;335559739&quot;:200,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 3\">Strategic Vision and Organizational Leadership</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:200,&quot;335559739&quot;:100,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"●\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;●&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\